   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Wouldn't that cause the opposite reaction, then?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "The reason the Lamaris fused faster@might be here in Karachi.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "(Or is someone's power@getting stronger...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "(This feeling...@The Cytron System is doing something...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "I see, so that's how it is.@Then that works out even better~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Sarayokose, meshiwokuuda,@Debudedabidebuu!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Ah, a Kaana type!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Hmm~? I can't transfer them all at once.@Why not~?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "So the clown's goal is to capture@a Lamaris Kaana!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Grrr, I have to send them one at a time~!@What a pain~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "He's got Lamaris for lackeys, so why go outta@his way to catch a big one? Why not just@combine 'em himself?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "'Cause he can't, that's why@he came out here like that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Including Skull Knight earlier, weren't they trying@to find out what makes the Kaana types appear?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "And they may have gotten their answer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Do they plan to use the Kaana types@as part of their forces too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "I think that's highly likely, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Save the speculating for later.@Letting that clown do as he pleases@doesn't sit well, that's how it is.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Whatever their goal, what we must do@is already decided.@Isn't that right, Kyosuke?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Roger. Assault 1 to all units.@Stop Debudedabide and wipe out the Lamaris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Bufu, that one's miiine!@Gimme your plate, gimme your grub,@Debudedabideboo!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Gufufu, neeext!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Gufu, this is the last one!@Gimme your plate, gimme your grub,@Debudedabideboo!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "My business here is done! Farewell!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Damn you, Debudedabide!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Assault 1 to all units.@Wipe out the remaining Lamaris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "The last Lamaris Kaana and@Debudedabide's signal are gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "What about the remaining Lamaris?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "No signals anywhere in the Karachi area.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "...The ship will hold <TD Hovering> here.@All units, maintain strict all-around vigilance@until the Lamaris are confirmed purified.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Grrr, you got in my way!@But I learned a lot this time~!",
