  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "...Captain, all enemy signals in the combat area@are gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Buhuu! I'm practically helping you all out,@you know~!@Don't get in my way~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Says who, ya blockhead!@It ain't enough just to make the Lamaris disappear!@Even less if you're the one haulin' 'em off!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "If you think you can gather Lamaris while Shoko@and the others are away, think again!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Buhuu, maybe Skull Knight's failure@was good luck for me~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "What do you mean...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Oi, you! What the hell d'ya think you're doin'?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Talking like Skull Knight~!@That ticks me off~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "If you hand the malice beings over to me,@you'll all have it easy, you know~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "We don't need your help to eliminate the Lamaris...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "If you don't do anything unnecessary,@I'll take care of the malice beings for you~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "An attractive offer, but it's obvious@it'd cause trouble down the line.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "You just keep quiet and watch@what I do~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "That's not what we came here for!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "I'm grateful to you all~!@So you can leave the rest to me~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "If the Kaana types appeared in response to us,@then we're the ones who have to eliminate them!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Don't you go stealing my prey,@you clown!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "All you do is defeat the malice beings~,@but I'm different~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Even more so if you're gonna use them!@I'll take you down right here!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Gathering that many Lamaris, you plannin'@on opening a haunted house or somethin'?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "If you're gonna say that, make it a circus~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Listen to yourself, sayin' it yourself!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Could it be you're the reason I can't@transfer the malice beings all at once~?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "I know nothing of that, but I won't give you@the Lamaris Kaana. Here I come!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "It seems you still haven't succeeded@in multiplying the Lamaris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "(Grr, this guy hit a sore spot~!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "The dimensional door you opened sent me flying@to the Endless Frontier.@I'm paying you back for that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "That was unexpected~.@It's too late to bring that up with me now~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "I'm not letting it end there, that's how it is!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Buhuhuu, thank you~.@Thanks to you, I got quite a harvest~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "So he did figure out what makes the Kaana types@appear...! If so, I won't let him go any further!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "This feeling...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Mmmh, did they react to this one~?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Katia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "What is this... It's like someone's watching me...@Is it because of the Cytron System?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "What is this... Someone's watching?@Is it because of the Cytron System?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Melua",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "I have a bad feeling...@Like someone's watching me...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "But it isn't Debudedabide...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Buhuu! Anyway, I won't let you get in my way~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "The Lamaris are one thing,@but we don't have time to deal with you!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Then keep your hands off and just watch~!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Pakistan - Karachi District",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Steel Dragons",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "...A few inferences can be drawn from this incident.@First, the <Dark Brain> remnants can control the@Lamaris, but apparently can't multiply or fuse them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "Raji",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Right... If they had a large number of them,@it wouldn't be strange for them to send them@to several places at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "But won't they try to build a Lamaris army eventually?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "That's highly likely.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "...They were looking for what makes the Kaana types@appear. And from what's happened so far, they@suspected some factor in the Steel Dragons...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "And Skull Knight tested that at Hindan.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "So that's why he sicced the Lamaris on us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "And it seems they got their answer@in the battle just now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "But I wonder why the Lamaris Kaana@showed up so fast?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "Lieutenant Arieil said there might be@some factor here in Karachi, didn't she?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Yes...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "Most likely, it's the malice that has clung@to this land over a long time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "Same as Dr. Kenzou Kobayashi's theory.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "Does that mean there are lots of earthbound@spirits here or something?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "Earthbound spirits...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "Don't go sayin' that's nonsense now, okay?@This is an age where ancient monsters show up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "...I know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "What is an earthbound spirit?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "It's a spirit that stays in one place 'cause@it doesn't realize it's dead, or can't accept it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "A spirit...@Isn't it all over once one's existence@is completely gone?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Even when the body's gone, the soul remains...@People have believed that since ancient times.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "Do you believe it too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "I won't deny it.@Someone showed me that it's possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "Right, you know it too, Raki.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "(I see... Ventus and Chris...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "Hey, d'ya think Fatso might show up in Paris too,@with all those Lamaris swarmin' there?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "Good point. Let's warn the Ginto detachment.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "(There are other beings that activate the Lamaris...@It's highly likely the Dark Brain remnants will set@their sights on the Ares Geist...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "Either way, we gotta finish off Fatso and his pals@before they put together a Lamaris army.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "I feel like building up their forces@isn't their only goal...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "Then what is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "That I don't know...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "Maybe they're plannin' to sell 'em to someone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "...That's an awfully bold idea.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "No kiddin'. Who'd they sell 'em to?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "Maybe the <Golaikunru>, of all people.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "That's a bit much...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "Then maybe they eat them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "...Spoken like a child.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "Either way, if they show up where the Lamaris are,@we'll just smash 'em all together.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "(I don't have time for that...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "(It's not the Lamaris, it's that man...@Al-Van that I have to defeat.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}